  "cues": [
   [
    0.106,
    "And ozone does something vital in return."
   ],
   [
    2.926,
    "The Sun sends three kinds of ultraviolet light toward Earth."
   ],
   [
    6.941,
    "U V C, the most dangerous, is stopped completely by the ozone layer."
   ],
   [
    12.261,
    "U V B is mostly absorbed, but some gets through."
   ],
   [
    15.731,
    "U V A, the weakest, passes almost freely."
   ],
   [
    19.508,
    "That's why the ozone layer is often called our planet's sunscreen."
   ],
   [
    23.404,
    "Without it, more U V B would reach us: more skin cancer and cataracts, weaker immune systems, damage to plankton and the young fish that start the ocean's food chain, and even plastics that crack and wear out sooner."
   ]
  ]
 },
