  "cues": [
   [
    0.12,
    "But ozone is not always a friend."
   ],
   [
    2.433,
    "The ozone near the ground is exactly the same molecule, made a different way."
   ],
   [
    7.606,
    "Exhaust from cars and industry releases nitrogen oxides and volatile organic compounds."
   ],
   [
    14.016,
    "In sunlight, they react and form ozone right where we breathe."
   ],
   [
    18.311,
    "It's a main ingredient of smog, it irritates the lungs, and it's why cities issue air quality alerts on hot, sunny days."
   ],
   [
    26.383,
    "So remember: ozone high up protects us."
   ],
   [
    29.375,
    "Ozone down here harms us."
   ]
  ]
